      "text": "I had the privilege of visiting Palmerston in 2003 as part of the crew of the tall ship Picton Castle.  We brought them cargo such as lumber and other needed items.  We stayed among the families for the five days we were there.  The hospitality was amazing.  I was particularly fond of Akarotoua Marster, who is honored at 2:55 in the video as the oldest resident.  She reminded me so much of my maternal grandmother.",
